flag is True, and result is satscores.cds, AVG(satscores.AvgScrRead)
FROM satscores
JOIN schools ON satscores.cds = schools.cds
WHERE schools.StatusType = 'Active'
GROUP BY satscores.cds
ORDER BY AVG(satscores.AvgScrRead) DESC
LIMIT 1;

This query will select the CDSCode of the school with the highest average score in Reading, by joining the satscores and schools table on the common CDSCode column. The query will filter the results to only include active schools, group the results by CDSCode, and order the results in descending order by average score. The last limit 1 clause will only return one result, the school with the highest average score in Reading.
