flag is True, and result is The SQL to retrieve the number of schools in Los Angeles with more than 500 free meals but less than 700 free or reduced price meals for K-12 would be:
```sql
SELECT 
    COUNT(*) as num_schools
FROM 
    satscores
WHERE 
    enroll12 > 500 AND enroll12 < 700
```
This query selects the count of schools where the number of free meals taken by students in grades K-12 is greater than 500 and less than 700. The resulting count is displayed as "num\_schools".
