Here is the SQL query that can be used to generate the required result:
```vbnet
SELECT COUNT(*)
FROM molecule
JOIN atom ON molecule.molecule_id = atom.molecule_id
JOIN connected ON atom.atom_id = connected.atom_id AND connected.bond_id IS NULL
WHERE molecule.label = '+' AND atom.element = 'n';
```
