-- What is the name of the set with the most cards?
SELECT
    sets.name AS setName,
    COUNT(*) AS cardCount
FROM sets
GROUP BY sets.name
ORDER BY cardCount DESC
LIMIT 1;

This query will return the name of the set with the most cards in the "sets" table, and the total number of cards in that set. It will group the sets by name, order the groups by the number of cards in descending order, and limit the result to only the set with the most cards.
