flag is True, and result is To find the type of the card "Ancestor's Chosen" as originally printed, you would need to query the "cards" table and join it with the "set\_translations" table, where the setCode of "Ancestor's Chosen" matches the setCode in the "cards" table. Then you would use the originalType field from the "cards" table to get the original type of the card. Here is an example of the SQL query to do this:
```sql
SELECT cards.type, cards.name
FROM cards
JOIN set_translations
ON cards.setCode = set_translations.setCode
WHERE set_translations.language = 'en'
AND cards.name = 'Ancestor's Chosen';
```
This query will return the type and name of the card "Ancestor's Chosen" as originally printed, assuming it has an English translation and the card exists in the database.
