flag is True, and result is 1. How many cards are having future frame version and what are the legality status of these cards?
```
SELECT COUNT(*) as total_cards,
       COUNT(CASE WHEN frame_version = 'future' THEN 1 END) as cards_with_future_frame_version,
       COUNT(CASE WHEN status = 'legal' THEN 1 END) as legal_cards
FROM cards
INNER JOIN rulings ON cards.uuid = rulings.uuid
```
This query will give you the total number of cards, number of cards with future frame version and number of legal cards.

