flag is True, and result is To list the set code of all cards translated into Spanish, you can use the following SQL query:
```
SELECT cards.setCode 
FROM sets 
JOIN set_translations ON sets.code = set_translations.setCode 
JOIN "cards" ON set_translations.cardKingdomId = cards.id 
WHERE language = 'Spanish'
```
This query will join the sets table with the set\_translations table on the code field, and then join the resulting table with the cards table on the cardKingdomId field. The WHERE clause filters the results to only include sets that have a Spanish language code. The resulting table will have the set code of all cards translated into Spanish.
