flag is True, and result is To answer the question of which artist the card with the text "Das perfekte Gegenmittel zu einer dichten Formation" belongs to, we would need to query the "cards" table and join it with the "set\_translations" table on the setCode column. We can then filter the results to only include cards that have a matching setCode in both tables and have the text "Das perfekte Gegenmittel zu einer dichten Formation" in the translated text column. Finally, we can select the artist column from the resulting rows to get the answer.

The following is the SQL query to achieve this:
```less
SELECT cards.artist 
FROM cards 
JOIN set_translations ON cards.setCode = set_translations.setCode 
WHERE cards.text = "Das perfekte Gegenmittel zu einer dichten Formation" AND set_translations.translation = "Das perfekte Gegenmittel zu einer dichten Formation";
```
This query will return the artist of the card with the text "Das
