flag is True, and result is To list any three unknown power cards that have promotional types for arena league, you would need to first check the cards that have a null or empty power value and then filter those that also have a promotional type of "arenaleague". Here is the SQL query to do that:
```scss
SELECT id, name, power, promoTypes
FROM cards
WHERE power = '*' OR power IS NULL
AND promoTypes = 'arenaleague'
```
This query selects the card ID, name, power value, and promoTypes from the cards table where power is either null or empty and also has a promoTypes value of "arenaleague". It will return any cards that match those criteria.
