flag is True, and result is To determine if a set has an expansion commander type, you can query the sets table and filter for sets with a "expansionCommander" type.
```
SELECT id FROM sets WHERE type = 'expansionCommander';
```
This will return all sets that have an expansion commander type.

You can also use the above query as a subquery in a larger query to filter the cards table by set.
```
SELECT id, name, text, mtgjsonV4Id
FROM cards
WHERE setCode IN (SELECT id FROM sets WHERE type = 'expansionCommander');
```
This will return all cards that belong to sets with an expansion commander type.
