flag is True, and result is To get the list of all types for the card "Molimo, Maro-Sorcerer", you can use the following SQL query:
```sql
SELECT subtypes, supertypes
FROM cards
WHERE name = 'Molimo, Maro-Sorcerer';
```
This query will select the subtypes and supertypes fields from the cards table where the name field equals 'Molimo, Maro-Sorcerer'.

The output of the query will be a table with two columns: subtypes and supertypes. Each row will contain a list of subtypes and supertypes for the card "Molimo, Maro-Sorcerer".
