flag is True, and result is To list the names of the cards in the set Coldsnap with the highest converted mana cost, you would need to join the "cards" table with the "set\_translations" table, and then select the cards that have a converted mana cost greater than the current highest converted mana cost.

Here is the SQL statement to achieve this:
```
SELECT cards.id, cards.name, cards.convertedManaCost
FROM cards
JOIN set_translations ON cards.setCode = set_translations.setCode
WHERE set_translations.language = 'en' AND convertedManaCost > (SELECT MAX(convertedManaCost) FROM cards WHERE setCode = 'Coldsnap');
```
