```
SELECT setCode
FROM sets
WHERE releaseDate = '2017-07-14';
```
This will select the `setCode` column from the `sets` table and return the set codes for sets that were released on 2017/7/14.

To filter the results further, you can use additional conditions in the WHERE clause. For example, if you want to find the set code for a specific card, you can use the following query:
```
SELECT setCode
FROM sets
JOIN set_translations st ON sets.code = st.setCode
JOIN cards c ON st.setCode = c.cardKingdomFoilId
WHERE releaseDate = '2017-07-14'
AND c.name = 'Card Name';
```
