flag is True, and result is To get the expansion type of the set "Huitième édition", you would need to query the "sets" table and look for the set with a matching name. Then, you would need to join the "set\_translations" table to get the translation of the set's name. Finally, you would need to use the translated name to get the set's expansion type from the "cards" table.

Here is the SQL query to get the expansion type of the set "Huitième édition":
```
WITH translated_name AS (
  SELECT translation AS translated_name
  FROM set_translations
  WHERE name = 'Huitième édition'
)
SELECT cards.expansion_type
FROM sets
JOIN set_translations ON sets.name = set_translations.name
JOIN translated_name ON cards.name = translated_name.translated_name
WHERE cards.expansion_type IS NOT NULL
```
