* The `SELECT` clause specifies which columns to return in the result set, in this case, `DisplayName` and `Age`.

This query will return the display name and age of the user with the highest number of views, given the current state of the `Users` table. If there are multiple users with the same maximum reputation, the query will return the first one it finds in the `Users` table.
