Here's the SQL query to achieve this:
```vbnet
SELECT r.raceId, r.number, r.position, r.positionText, r.points, c.name
FROM races AS r
JOIN results AS r ON r.raceId = r.raceId AND r.position = 2
JOIN constructors AS c ON r.constructorId = c.constructorId
WHERE r.year = 2006 AND r.raceNumber = 2;
```
