flag is True, and result is To find the races in year 2017 that are not hosted in year 2000, we can use the following SQL query:
```
SELECT raceId
FROM races
WHERE year = 2017 AND raceId NOT IN (
    SELECT raceId
    FROM races
    WHERE year = 2000
)
```
This query will select the `raceId` of all races in year 2017 that are not also in year 2000.

-- If you want to check only the races that were in year 2000 and not in 2017:
```
SELECT raceId
FROM races
WHERE year = 2000 AND raceId NOT IN (
    SELECT raceId
    FROM races
    WHERE year = 2017
)
```
This query will select the `raceId` of all races in year 2000 that are not also in year 2017.
