Here is the SQL query to determine the last Formula 1 season in which Brands Hatch hosted the British Grand Prix:
```
SELECT year
FROM seasons
WHERE url = (
    SELECT url
    FROM circuits
    WHERE name = "Brands Hatch"
)
AND name = "British Grand Prix"
```
This query will return the `year` field from the `seasons` table, which represents the last year in which the British Grand Prix was held at Brands Hatch.

