flag is True, and result is circuits.alt
FROM circuits
WHERE circuits.alt = (
    SELECT MAX(alt)
    FROM circuits
)

This query will retrieve the highest altitude from the alt column of the circuits table and return the circuit name associated with that altitude.

-- How many constructors participated in the 2019 FIA Formula One World Championship?
SELECT COUNT(constructorId)
FROM constructors
WHERE constructorRef = '2019 FIA Formula One World Championship'

This query will count the number of constructors that participated in the 2019 FIA Formula One World Championship, as specified by the constructorRef column.

-- Which constructor had the highest number of points in the 2019 FIA Formula One World Championship?
SELECT constructorId
FROM constructors
WHERE constructorRef = '2019 FIA Formula One World Championship'
ORDER BY points DESC
LIMIT 1

This query will retrieve the constructor ID of the constructor that had the highest
