This query will find the circuit with the highest altitude and return the altitude value from the circuits table, along with the country name where the highest altitude can be found. The subquery `(SELECT MAX(alt) FROM circuits)` finds the maximum altitude value in the entire circuits table, and the `WHERE` clause filters the results to only include rows where the altitude is equal to the maximum altitude and the country is equal to 'Norway'.
