flag is True, and result is Sure, here's the SQL query to get the driver with the fastest lap speed in a Formula\_1 race:
```sql
SELECT drivers.forename, drivers.surname
FROM drivers
JOIN constructors ON drivers.constructorRef = constructors.constructorRef
JOIN races ON drivers.raceRef = races.raceId
WHERE races.lap_speed_tier = (SELECT MAX(lap_speed_tier) FROM races)
```
This query will join the `drivers`, `constructors`, and `races` tables and filter the results to only include races where the lap\_speed\_tier is the maximum value in the `races` table. It will then return the forename and surname of the driver who participated in that race.
