flag is True, and result is SELECT drivers.forename, drivers.surname
FROM drivers
JOIN laptimes ON drivers.driverId = laptimes.driverId
JOIN results ON laptimes.lap = (SELECT MAX(lap) FROM laptimes WHERE raceId = results.raceId)
WHERE status.statusId = 1;

This query will retrieve the forename and surname of the driver with the fastest lap time for each race. It will join the drivers table with the laptimes table on the driverId column, and then join the results table on the lap column to only select the lap that has the maximum time for each race. Finally, it filters the results based on the statusId column of the status table, which is set to 1 for a win.
