flag is True, and result is To answer the question "Which of the Italian constructors got the highest point to date? Give its introduction website?", we can use the following SQL query:
```vbnet
SELECT constructors.constructorId, constructors.name, points.points
FROM constructors
JOIN constructorResults ON constructors.constructorId = constructorResults.constructorId
JOIN races ON constructorResults.raceId = races.raceId
JOIN driverStandings ON races.raceId = driverStandings.raceId
JOIN drivers ON driverStandings.driverId = drivers.driverId
JOIN constructorStandings ON constructorResults.constructorId = constructorStandings.constructorId
WHERE nationality = 'Italian'
ORDER BY points DESC
LIMIT 1;
```
This query joins the `constructors`, `constructorResults`, `races`, `driverStandings`, `drivers`, and `constructorStandings` tables to select the Italian constructor with the highest point total and its name. We use the `WHERE` clause to filter the
