flag is True, and result is To find the fastest lap time among all the lap records set on various circuits, we can use the following SQL query:
```sql
SELECT fastestLapTime
FROM lapTimes
WHERE circuitId = (
    SELECT circuitId
    FROM circuits
    WHERE name = 'Circuit Name' -- Replace 'Circuit Name' with the name of the circuit
    AND country = 'Country Name' -- Replace 'Country Name' with the name of the country
)
AND fastestLapTime = (
    SELECT MAX(fastestLapTime)
    FROM lapTimes
    WHERE circuitId = (
        SELECT circuitId
        FROM circuits
        WHERE name = 'Circuit Name' -- Replace 'Circuit Name' with the name of the circuit
        AND country = 'Country Name' -- Replace 'Country Name' with the name of the country
    )
)
```
