Here is the SQL query to answer the question:
```vbnet
SELECT drivers.forename, drivers.surname, pitStops.stop, lapTimes.time, pitStops.duration
FROM laps
JOIN pitStops ON laps.driverId = pitStops.driverId AND laps.lap = pitStops.lap
JOIN drivers ON laps.driverId = drivers.driverId
GROUP BY drivers.driverId
ORDER BY pitStops.stop DESC;
```
