flag is True, and result is ```sql
SELECT p.preferred_foot, p.potential
FROM player p
JOIN team t ON p.team_api_id = t.team_api_id
JOIN match m ON t.team_fifa_api_id = m.home_team_fifa_api_id
WHERE m.match_id = (SELECT MIN(match_id) FROM match WHERE home_team_fifa_api_id = t.team_fifa_api_id)
GROUP BY p.preferred_foot, p.potential
