-- What is the average number of goals scored by the home team in the English Premier League in the last 3 seasons?
Generate the SQL after thinking step by step:
SELECT
    COUNT(goals) AS total_goals,
    AVG(goals) AS avg_goals
FROM
    match
WHERE
    league_id = 1
    AND home_team_score > 0
    AND match_date BETWEEN DATE(NOW() - INTERVAL 3 YEAR) AND NOW()
GROUP BY
    match.match_id;
```
