flag is True, and result is To determine which player is older, Aaron Lennon or Abdelaziz Barrada, we can use the "League" and "Team" tables. We can first join the two tables on the "country\_id" and "team\_api\_id" columns, and then use a comparison operator to compare the "birthday" column of both players.

Here's the generated SQL:
```sql
SELECT b.name AS player_name, a.birthday AS birthday
FROM League l
JOIN Team t ON l.id = t.league_id
JOIN Team_Attributes ta ON t.team_api_id = ta.team_fifa_api_id
JOIN Player p ON t.team_api_id = p.team_api_id
JOIN Team a ON p.team_api_id = a.team_api_id
JOIN Team b ON p.team_api_id = b.team_api_id AND a.b
