flag is True, and result is The Belgium Jupiler League is from Belgium.

To get the country of the Belgium Jupiler League, we can use the `Country` table and join it with the `League` table on the `id` column, and then select the `name` column of the `Country` table:
```sql
SELECT c.name AS country
FROM League l
JOIN Country c ON l.country_id = c.id;
```
This will return the name of the country for the Belgium Jupiler League.
