* We then use a `WHERE` clause to filter the rows based on the `year_of_birth` column.
* We compare the `year_of_birth` value with `35` using the `<` operator. This means that only the rows with a `year_of_birth` value less than `35` will be returned.

This query will give us a list of all players who are 35 years old and above.
