flag is True, and result is To answer the question "Which league had the most games in the 2015–2016 season?", we can use the following SQL query:
```vbnet
SELECT League.name AS league_name, COUNT(*) AS game_count
FROM League
JOIN Match ON League.id = Match.league_id
JOIN Team ON Match.home_team_id = Team.id
JOIN Country ON Team.country_id = Country.id
WHERE Season = '2015/2016'
GROUP BY League.name
ORDER BY game_count DESC
LIMIT 1;
```
This query selects the name of the league and the count of games played by teams in that league during the 2015-2016 season. It joins the `League`, `Match`, `Team`, and `Country` tables, filters the results to only include matches played during the 2015-2016 season, groups the results by league name,
