flag is True, and result is To get the ID, sex, and birthday of all patients diagnosed with 'RA' that are within the UN normal index, you can use the following SQL query:
```
SELECT Patient.ID, Patient.SEX, Patient.Birthday
FROM Patient
JOIN Laboratory ON Patient.ID = Laboratory.ID
JOIN Examination ON Laboratory.ID = Examination.ID
