Here is the SQL query to retrieve the hometown state of "Sacha Harrison":
```vbnet
SELECT m.first_name, m.last_name, z.short_state
FROM member m
JOIN zip_code z ON m.zip = z.zip
JOIN major m ON z.type = m.department
WHERE m.first_name = 'Sacha' AND m.last_name = 'Harrison' AND z.short_state = m.state;
```
This query will return the first name, last name, and hometown state of Sacha Harrison, assuming that they exist in the database and that the join conditions are met.
