flag is True, and result is SELECT m.first\_name, m.last\_name
FROM member m
JOIN attendance a ON m.member\_id = a.link\_to\_member
JOIN event e ON a.link\_to\_event = e.event\_id
WHERE e.event\_name = 'October Meeting'

